        "text": "# Active Filter\n\n**Active filters** are the current rules that are being applied to a set of data and are clearly shown to the user. \n\nThey explain how the data is being limited right now.\n\n**Example:** A label that describes your rule, like _\"Showing only comedy movies with a rating of 4 or higher\"_ is an example of displaying **active filters.**\n",
